ion/deployments","created_at":"2025-03-05T14:47:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T12:52:11Z","pushed_at":"2026-10-07T12:23:18Z","git_url":"git://github.com/eclipse-score/communication.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:eclipse-score/communication.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-score/communication.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-score/communication","homepage":null,"size":19478,"stargazers_count":61,"watchers_count":61,"language":"C++","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":101,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":203,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":true,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":101,"open_issues":203,"watchers":61,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/communication/pulls/1267","html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-score/communication/pull/1267","diff_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-score/communication/pull/1267.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-score/communication/pull/1267.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-05T15:18:36Z"},"body":"Remove `tags = [\"manual\"]` from com-api-example-tokio-integration-test so it runs in regular `bazel test` invocations.\r\n    \r\nMark the target target_compatible_with = incompatible when any sanitizer is enabled, so it is skipped in sanitizer builds. The reason is documented in the BUILD file.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/eclipse-score/communication/issues/794\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/communication/issues/1267/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/communication/issues/1267/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/communication/issues/comments/5989194366","html_url":"https://github.com/eclipse-score/communication/issues/794#issuecomment-5989194366","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/communication/issues/794","id":5989194366,"node_id":"IC_kwDOODov5M8AAAABZPvafg","user":{"login":"bharatGoswami8","id":228470805,"node_id":"U_kgDODZ4wFQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228470805?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bharatGoswami8","html_url":"https://github.com/bharatGoswami8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bharatGoswami8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bharatGoswami8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bharatGoswami8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bharatGoswami8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bharatGoswami8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bharatGoswami8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bharatGoswami8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bharatGoswami8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bharatGoswami8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-05T06:20:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T06:20:31Z","body":"Update on removing `tags = [\"manual\"]` from the Rust test targets:\n\nEnabled (manual tag removed)\n- `//score/mw/com/impl/rust/com-api/com-api-runtime-lola:com-api-runtime-lola-tests`\n- `//score/mw/com/rust/score_com_concept:score_com_concept-test`\n\nBoth pass in the default build and under `--config=asan_ubsan_lsan` and `--config=tsan_ubsan`. The sanitizer issue that was the reason for the tag no longer reproduces.\n\nEnabled, but skipped under sanitizers\n- `//score/mw/com/example/com-api-example:com-api-example-tokio-integration-test`\n\nThe tag is removed, so it runs in normal `bazel test` runs, but I excluded it from sanitizer builds. The tests pass functionally, but the Tokio multi-thread runtime (`#[tokio::test(flavor = \"multi_thread\")]`) triggers sanitizer findings:\n- `asan_ubsan_lsan`: LeakSanitizer reports , all from `tokio::runtime::scheduler::multi_thread::MultiThread::new` / worker thread startup.\n- `tsan_ubsan`: data race in `<String as Clone>::clone` between the test thread and a `tokio-rt-worker` thread. Neither stack frame is in COM code.\n\nThe target uses `target_compatible_with = select({\"@score_cpp_policies//sanitizers/flags:any_sanitizer\": [\"@platforms//:incompatible\"], \"//conditions:default\": []})`. It is built and run normally and reported as SKIPPED under any sanitizer config. The reason is documented in the BUILD file.\n\nStill `manual`\n- `//score/mw/com/rust/score_com_concept:score_com_concept-macros-tests` (doc test). `rust_doc_test` does not forward native C++ link flags, which fails with LLD. This is unrelated to the sanitizers.\n\n**Follow-up**\nThe Tokio sanitizer findings (leak and race) need to investigate, either to fix the test/runtime setup or to add targeted suppressions. Once that is done, the `target_compatible_with` restriction can be removed.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/communication/issues/comments/5989194366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"bharatGoswami8","id":228470805,"node_id":"U_kgDODZ4wFQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228470805?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://a