:true}},"body":"### What\n\nAs part of #794, manual was removed from these Rust tests. They only build and run on Linux, so they carry target_compatible_with = [\"@platforms//os:linux\"]:\n\n```\n//score/mw/com/impl/rust/com-api/com-api-runtime-lola:com-api-runtime-lola-tests\n//score/mw/com/rust/score_com_concept:score_com_concept-test\n```\nThey are plain rust_test targets, with no QNX build or test path like the one `rust_unit_test` provides.\n\nThe Tokio integration test //score/mw/com/example/com-api-example:com-api-example-tokio-integration-test stays manual. Without the tag, the QNX build fails because socket2 0.6.5 can't resolve libc::TCP_KEEPIDLE. It also has sanitizer findings, which are out of scope here.\n\nGoal\n\nMake these Rust tests build and run for QNX, and remove the Linux-only constraint.\n\nAcceptance criteria\n\nbazel build/test --config=ci --config=qnx -- //score/... passes with the Linux constraint removed from the two tests.\nThe Tokio socket2 QNX build failure is resolved.\n\n### How\n\n_No response_\n\n### Estimates for realization\n\n_No response_\n\n### Category\n\n- [ ] Affects Detailed Design\n\n### Requirements / Architecture\n\n- [x] Requirements / Architecture are not affected by this change?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/communication/issues/1278/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/communication/issues/1278/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":32522587150,"node_id":"REFE_lADOODov5M8AAAABKbQvkM8AAAAHkn9MDg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eclipse-score/communication/issues/events/32522587150","actor":{"login":"etas-contrib-automation[bot]","id":240699459,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODljIQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223654442?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.git